rustc_codegen_js: keep memchr scalar on the JavaScript heap.

The standard word-at-a-time implementation is profitable for native memory,
but this backend represents byte slices as JavaScript arrays. Its aligned path
therefore expands into pointer retyping, alignment, bounds, and panic machinery
before returning to a scalar array scan. Use the existing const-safe scalar
implementation for this custom sysroot.

